Title: Merge two laravel AJAX function , in one route.
Body: <p>I am trying to insert data into database and my both functions are working, but when I try to make it shorter and put some common content then it is not working.
I think issue is with in my first function, I am using image and for that contentType all details are different, that's why it is not working</p>
<p>This is my first function, which is for single input form</p>
<pre><code>&lt;script&gt;
