Title: Getting and Verifying Image Headers Expires.
Body: <p>I am working on SEO and need to verify that Image Headers Expires is working. Both modules for expires and headers are installed and enabled.</p>
<p>Any ideas?</p>
<p>The .htaccess file has this in it</p>
<pre><code>&lt;IfModule mod_expires.c&gt;
ExpiresByType application/javascript &quot;access plus 2 days&quot;
  ExpiresByType image/jpg &quot;access plus 1 month&quot;
  ExpiresByType image/jpeg &quot;access plus 1 month&quot;
  ExpiresByType image/gif &quot;access plus 1 month&quot;
  ExpiresByType image/png &quot;access plus 1 month&quot;
