```

This code calculates the sum and average of all `leaves` values in the `tree_dict` by key name. The `leaves_sum` variable will contain the sum of all `leaves` values, and the `leaves_avg` variable will contain the average of all `leaves` values.

You can also modify the code to calculate the sum and average of specific named values in the `tree_dict` by key name. For example, if you want to calculate the sum and average of the `geometry` values in the `tree_dict`, you can modify the code as follows:

```python
